@startuml US073_SSD
title US073 - Create Flight Route - SSD

actor "ATCC" as Collab
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Collab -> System : request to create a flight route
System --> Collab : request route metadata (ID, Company, Origin, Destination)

Collab -> System : input route metadata
System --> Collab : request data for first segment (Start/End coords, Wind, Altitude)

Collab -> System : input segment data
System --> Collab : ask if wants to add another segment

alt wants to add more segments
    Collab -> System : yes
    System --> Collab : request data for next segment
    Collab -> System : input segment data
end

Collab -> System : confirm completion
System --> Collab : display success message and save route
@enduml